<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Delta half year profit rises.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Delta half year profit rises.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1997-03-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to December 31</p>
<p>		 (million A$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Operating profit		    11.56 vs 11.97</p>
<p>    Net				     10.04 vs 6.91</p>
<p>    Dividend (cents)		     1.5 vs nil</p>
<p>NOTE: Delta Gold NL is a gold miner. Company owns 33 percent of the Hartley platinum mine in Zimbabwe with Broken Hill Proprietary owning the other 67 percent.  </p>
<p>    Sales				   52.93 vs 53.45</p>
<p>    Other income			   9.08 vs 1.28</p>
<p>    Shr (cents)			    4.88 vs 3.39</p>
<p>Dividend is 100 percent franked</p>
<p>Pay date April 15</p>
<p>Reg date April 2</p>
<p>    Abnormal items			  3.83 vs nil</p>
<p>    Tax					 5.35 vs 5.061</p>
<p>    Interest				  nil vs nil</p>
<p>    Depreciation			    6.74 vs 9.95</p>
<p>-- Sydney Newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
</text>
